WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.213
"Are you sure you want to skate?" Harry asked Mom.

2
00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:11.281
"You usually just watch."

3
00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:18.674
Mom laced up her skates. "I'm sure."

4
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:27.448
Dad and the kids joined the crowd on the ice.

5
00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:34.064
Then Mom stepped onto the ice.

6
00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:38.594
But she hung onto the boards.

7
00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:42.923
The others gathered around her.

8
00:00:42.924 --> 00:00:46.139
Everyone had a helpful tip.

9
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:54.679
"Don't hold onto the boards," Harry said.

10
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:59.252
"Stop looking at your feet," Emmy said.

11
00:00:59.253 --> 00:01:03.050
"Take little marching steps," Dad said.

12
00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:08.970
Mom frowned. "I know how to skate."

13
00:01:08.971 --> 00:01:12.722
"Don't worry about falling," Oliver said.

14
00:01:12.723 --> 00:01:17.035
"I'll show you how to get up."

15
00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:20.577
"Thanks, Oliver," Mom said.

16
00:01:20.578 --> 00:01:25.499
"I just need to practice by myself."

17
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:35.511
"Let's race!" Dad said to the kids.

18
00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:38.763
Everyone skated fast.

19
00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:42.426
Tweet! The guard blew her whistle.

20
00:01:42.427 --> 00:01:48.859
"No racing!" she said.

21
00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.860
Dad tapped Emmy's shoulder.

22
00:01:51.861 --> 00:02:04.399
"Let's play tag! You're 'it'!"

23
00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.779
Tweet!

24
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:11.162
"No playing tag," the guard said.

25
00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:15.060
"Let's skate backward," Dad said.

26
00:02:15.061 --> 00:02:21.261
Everyone turned around and skated backward.

27
00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:23.155
Tweet!

28
00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:28.840
"No skating backward," the guard said.

29
00:02:28.841 --> 00:02:30.938
"You broke three rules.

30
00:02:30.939 --> 00:02:35.677
Please leave the ice for 15 minutes."

31
00:02:35.678 --> 00:02:39.563
Dad and the kids sat down on a bench.

32
00:02:39.564 --> 00:02:43.705
Mom waved as she glided past.

33
00:02:43.706 --> 00:02:50.662
"Mom's skating!" Emmy said.

34
00:02:50.663 --> 00:02:53.995
"She's doing great!" Oliver said.

35
00:02:53.996 --> 00:03:02.803
Harry sighed. "And we're just watching!"

